  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a clay pot over medium-high heat. ",
    "Add the onion, garlic, and green chili; cook until the onion is translucent. ",
    "Add the pork shoulder, soy sauce, fish sauce, brown sugar, salt, and black pepper; stir well to coat. ",
    "Add bay leaves and stir well. ",
    "Cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally. ",
    "Stir in fresh cilantro. ",
    "Serve hot."
  ],
